# Generator-emitted .rst pages are regenerated by interfacegen on each
# release run (see share/design/CODEGEN.md). They are intentionally not
# tracked in git on the codegen base branch — they only appear on
# release branches after the generator has run.
#
# Handcoded pages (rocm.bindings.util.rst, hip.rst) ARE tracked and
# must be force-added with `git add -f` if needed.
*.rst
!rocm.bindings.util.rst
!hip.rst
